# Optional provider credentials for worker and recovery supervisor only.
# Copy to /etc/gpu-control/worker-secrets.env, root:root mode 0600, only when
# an explicitly reviewed provider integration needs credentials. Keep this
# file absent or empty while provider integrations are disabled.
# Never place database, OAuth, cookie, workload, or policy settings here.
# Example Modal API token variables (obtain values from the approved secret store):
# MODAL_TOKEN_ID=REDACTED
# MODAL_TOKEN_SECRET=REDACTED
